note hsum: a unit with private helpers. The compiler enters a function-mode unit at its last function
note (word 0 branches there), so only that function is bound; sq and cap are internal calls.
fn sq x ulong to ulong
ret mul x x
end

fn cap x ulong to ulong
if gt x 1000000
trap 9
end
ret x
end

fn hsum a view uchar 4 b ulong to ulong
s = b
for i ulong 4
s = add s sq ulong get a i
end
ret cap s
end
